1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,600
How do we score in Level Up? With bean bags!

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:09,700
Drop a bean bag in the floor goal: one point.

3
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:14,200
Put it on top of the pyramid: three points!

4
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,600
Now here's the secret.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:23,400
Put a bag ON TOP of another bag on the pyramid, and it reaches the next level: six points!

6
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:25,100
That's double!

7
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:30,800
So the best teams drop every bag in the exact same spot, so they stack.

8
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:36,400
One, three, six. Higher means more points!

